      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name} it is also easy to accidentally click ? instead of the back button.\n\nSwapping them would reduce a lot of mistakes, but really an additional wheel to add your nine favourite emoji would stop a lot of awkward mistakes and wheel swapping!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
