      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "+1\n\nAlso:\n\nSince the user configurable action-menu update the \"recently used\" emote category changed its behaviour.\n\nIt used to remember ALL emotes you did use, now it only remembers custom emotes, all non-custom ones vanish from the category with a vrc restart.\n\nUsed to add ALL my regulary used emotes & only pick em out of \"recently used\".\n\nWould LOVE to have the previous behaviour back, also an extention to 16 category entries - like it happened with custom emotes.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
