  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-02-19T06:04:08.998Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It is common in the event scene that wrong emoji are sent out. Sometimes it is funny, but it can also make you embarrassed.\n\nMoving a few of the most misused emoji such as \"?\" or \"coal\" would be nice.\n\nIdeally, an additional empty emoji menu that you can customise with preferred default emoji would be helpful.\n\n日本語の機械翻訳🙏：イベントで誤って間違った絵文字を送信してしまうことはよくありますが、これは恥ずかしいことです。 可能であれば、お気に入りのデフォルト絵文字を追加できる空の絵文字メニューを追加すると良いでしょう。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Lemons_vrc/status/1758857810861805717",
